# Extracted reMarkable resources: proprietary code pulled off the device for
# local reference only (see tools/rccdump/README.md and docs/QMD-NOTES.md).
# NEVER commit anything under here.
#
# The glob covers the per-OS-version trees too (qmlroot328/ and any future
# one). Each holds a copy of xochitl itself plus its whole QML tree — tens of
# megabytes of somebody else's code, and the single worst thing that could be
# pushed to a public repository from here.
/qmlroot*/

# go build output
/rccdump
/probe-batch

# AppLoad PC emulator: cloned and built locally, never vendored (PLAN §1.4)
/.emulator/

# macOS
.DS_Store
